{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring that childhood feeling back \u2014 a small creature that depends on you, gently. Your <strong>desktop companion</strong> sits at the edge of the screen while you work, study, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It asks for simple care: food, water, bath, play, cleaning \u2014 and responds with tiny moods and animations that make everyday moments feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no heavy micromanagement: quick interactions, soothing vibes. As days pass, your pet <strong>grows</strong> and shows new behaviors. Leave it alone for too long, and it may <strong>get sick</strong> \u2014 or even <strong>pass away</strong>. The heart of the game is the bond you build: return, care, and watch happiness bloom again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.mp4?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to daily care, you can also <strong>customize your companion and environment</strong> with adorable items that add even more charm and personality to your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why you\u2019ll love it</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real companionship:</strong> always there, never in the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle care loop:</strong> subtle reminders, quick actions, stress-free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based growth:</strong> evolving stages and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; cute:</strong> soft, comforting atmosphere for everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful stakes:</strong> your attention truly matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legal note</strong><br>*\u201c<strong>Tamagotchi</strong>\u201d is a trademark of Bandai. This game is <strong>not</strong> affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by Bandai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTA</strong><br>Like it? <strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> to stay in the loop.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adopt your first pet!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/9d08401efc8fb32fabd1b9a116ab7e7fba406129.jpg"},{"name":"First Patch-Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/c7bf8aef4d347b6c5b1e9e2e4a7ffedf225a1f51.jpg"},{"name":"First Cleanup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/ce8fe646321e3577b8819f2ea42a76212bd4f250.jpg"},{"name":"First Feeding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/3862ce4eb0fc78061d717d9f5d2428b1b889b7b4.jpg"},{"name":"Cleanup Intern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/2e6ee147c912ca3f990a9c3cda90d27265d94838.jpg"},{"name":"Cleanup Crew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/ff7773d0d01aeed60e9350e66ea287d8e05be1a6.jpg"},{"name":"All Grown Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/4489cf776bae2ce7a69c77109d44bae6eac3c900.jpg"},{"name":"One Week Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/7710a75462e9240853ef2c89bbd9db8d6cd799be.jpg"},{"name":"Two Weeks Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/32248e0df3eabd223982517aa9f53c7085de9037.jpg"},{"name":"Model Pet Parent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964530/8da871abd3004c63c85adaafa6fcd151551bb189.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964530?t=1758214817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964530?t=1758214817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/376eb5f66eabca1a7eba7be8e0f6aa1210693c4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758214817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/376eb5f66eabca1a7eba7be8e0f6a